QUERY NAME: vid-out
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW tlkpTestCapability.PlanPortfolio, tlkpTestCapability.WorkGroup, tlkpTestCapability.TestCode, MonthlyOutput.Buyer, MonthlyOutput.Month, MonthlyOutput.Volume
FROM tlkpTestCapability INNER JOIN MonthlyOutput ON (tlkpTestCapability.WorkGroup = MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup) AND (tlkpTestCapability.TestCode = MonthlyOutput.TestCode)
WHERE ((tlkpTestCapability.PlanPortfolio Like "vid*"));

